'Tree');\n```\n\ncreate a new \"Zone\" element from POST form like : \n\n``` php\n$this->Zone->save($this->request->data);\n```\n\nwill cause a SQL query as the following :  \n\n``` sql\nSELECT MAX(\"Zone\".\"rght\") AS \"rght\" \nFROM \"mpdefault\".\"zones\" AS \"Zone\" \nWHERE 1 = 1 AND \"Zone\".\"id\" <> 126 ORDER BY \"reference\" ASC LIMIT 1\n```\n\nMySQL will accept it but PostgreSQL will throw this error : \n\n```\nError: SQLSTATE[42803]: Grouping error: 7 ERROR: column \"Zone.reference\" must appear in the GROUP BY clause or be used in an aggregate function LINE 1: ...RE 1 = 1 AND \"Zone\".\"id\" <> 126 ORDER BY \"reference... ^ \n```\n\nThe only way I found to run my application was to completely remove the property Zone::$order\n","closed_by":{"login":"rbecheras","id":6469390,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NjkzOTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6469390?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbecheras","html_url":"https://github.com/rbecheras","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbecheras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbecheras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbecheras/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbecheras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbecheras/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbecheras/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbecheras/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbecheras/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbecheras/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/5155/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/5155/timeline","performed_via_github_app":n